      "id": "claim_6852988986b642f0be701c518e5978fc",
      "statement": "Recipe files are named recipe-pw__<service>.yaml (prefix recipe-pw__, service name lowercased with spaces replaced by underscores) and both consumers derive the same path: the batch engine from service.lower().replace(\" \", \"_\") and the daemon runner from config.recipe_path_for or the Task.recipe_file column.",
