      "id": "claim_125c0994c6c5451e89e35072e6fa0892",
      "statement": "A download is a step whose methods contain expect_download plus nested steps, which execute inside page.expect_download(); the resulting file is saved to the download directory (batch) or recorded via downloads.track_download (daemon: url, filename, size, sha256, saved path, per-task sha256 dedup), and a run succeeds only if it completes without aborting and at least one download entry has result success.",
