    {
      "id": "claim_11d7379b338849d3aea186c1c19e2196",
      "statement": "The placeholders {{USERNAME}}, {{PASSWORD}}, and {{OTP}} are substituted at run time by exact-string match from the run's vault credentials (embedded occurrences in longer strings are left as-is); the daemon runner overrides {{OTP}} to re-fetch the item's current TOTP from the vault at substitution time (_fresh_otp) because a run-start code can be stale, falling back to the run-start value on fetch failure.",
      "evidence": [
