    {
      "id": "claim_5cec7250d9a24452a7e006645540027d",
      "statement": "wait_user is a daemon-runner-only step method: such a step pauses before execution (reason=wait_user) and is consumed, not re-executed, on resume; optional prompt and until arguments are supported, with until a locator dict (keys role, test_id, placeholder, label, text, selector) that must be visible for the step to complete, bounded by the pause deadline with a missed deadline re-pausing, and an unrecognized until key aborting the step as a recipe authoring error.",
      "evidence": [
