      "id": "claim_9f74e1713c6c4fc99a8a6710731a53f0",
      "statement": "The UI recipe path uses billcollector.recipes.validate_recipe - yaml.safe_load plus jsonschema.Draft7Validator against config.RECIPE_SCHEMA returning a structured (ok, error, data) triple with path-qualified error text and never raising - and save_recipe re-validates at the write site, then writes a temp file in the same directory and os.replace's it over the recipe, so the file is never left half-written.",
