      "id": "claim_f3accba406714730acb2602e157e71ea",
      "statement": "helpers/BillCollectorCreateRecipe_pw.py builds recipes from Playwright codegen: -g runs playwright codegen (Python target) into recipes_playwright/.code/<service>.py and interactively prompts replacing sensitive .fill() literals with {{USERNAME}}/{{PASSWORD}}/{{OTP}} (keyword-based suggestions from VARIABLE_LABELS); -t translates the captured Python script into the recipe YAML, turning chained page.* calls into method entries, with page.expect_download() blocks into the nested-steps shape, and writes recipe-pw__<service>.yaml with the $schema field set.",
